### Create Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employee/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amir",
  "lastname": "Timur",
  "phone": "333",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "employeeId": "b45294ac-865f-4032-bc05-58811f0ec623"
}

### Get by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employee/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update employee
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employee/update/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "lastname": "",
  "phone": "",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "employeeId": ""
}

### Delete employee
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employee/delete/{{id}}